OL,4,CSocial poker with #5 stake is booming, 
OL,5,Csays dealer                            
OL,6,GA man who organises social poker       
OL,7,Gsessions in pubs and clubs said the    
OL,8,Ggame's growing popularity could be     
OL,9,Gdown to the cost-of-living crisis.     
OL,11,FPhillip Steer, from March,             
OL,12,FCambridgeshire, has run poker nights   
OL,13,Fin Fenland for 14 years and said he    
OL,14,Fhas seen a 35% rise in the number of   
OL,15,Fplayers in the area since 2022, with   
OL,16,Fnow about "100 players across 15 clubs 
OL,17,Fand pubs".                             
OL,19,FSteer added that as people can only    
OL,20,Fplace a maximum #5 stake, the game was 
OL,21,Foften "cheaper" than other pastimes.   
